di?\n\n```text\nset [score] to (10)\nrepeat until <(score) = (10)>\n  change [score] by (1)\nend\n```","options":["0","1","10","Cheksiz"],"correct":0,"explanation":"repeat until sharti ishga kirishda rost. Shuning uchun tana bir marta ham bajarilmaydi.","difficulty":2,"cognitive":"qollash","source":"ICT 5/6 (2020/2021) Scratch/LOGO mavzulari; 2026 spetsifikatsiya PDF 4","assets":[],"status":"review","lesson_id":"97000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003","construct_id":"303d85fb-0395-4636-8668-e333cdc0fbf5","source_reference":"M07-AUDIT-20261020:M07-A26-04; source=ICT 5/6 (2020/2021) Scratch/LOGO mavzulari; 2026 spetsifikatsiya PDF 4; ORIGINAL_REVIEW","payload":{"correct_option_id":"35dfc9e6-892f-51a1-8b3b-a9dd18c81b1b"},"option_rows":[{"id":"35dfc9e6-892f-51a1-8b3b-a9dd18c81b1b","side":"a","order_idx":0,"content":"0"},{"id":"0bf82584-c92b-5c42-be4d-5c64fae37453","side":"a","order_idx":1,"content":"1"},{"id":"be4ba77d-c5a8-501f-ba7d-523654e64daf","side":"a","order_idx":2,"content":"10"},{"id":"16dd4b41-2a88-57b5-a295-7492cc07744d","side":"a","order_idx":3,"content":"Cheksiz"}]},{"id":"M07-A26-05","uuid":"cf44e182-2e9e-53d6-8fac-46cba1bf1bb6","lesson":4,"format":"Y1","stem":"Scratch hisoblagichi uchun ushbu bloklar bajarilganda `count` qancha bo‘ladi?\n\n```text\nset [count] to (0)\nrepeat (5)\n  change [count] by (2)\n  if <(count) > (6)> then\n    change [count] by (-1)\n  end\nend\n```","options":["8","9","10","7"],"correct":0,"explanation":"Ketma-ket qiymatlar: 2, 4, 6, 7 (8−1), 8 (9−1). Yakuniy qiymat 8.","difficulty":4,"cognitive":"mulohaza","source":"ICT 5/6 (2020/2021) Scratch/LOGO mavzulari; 2026 spetsifikatsiya PDF 4","assets":[],"status":"review","lesson_id":"97000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003","construct_id":"303d85fb-0395-4636-8668-e333cdc0fbf5","source_reference":"M07-AUDIT-20261020:M07-A26-05; source=ICT 5/6 (2020/2021) Scratch/LOGO mavzulari; 2026 spetsifikatsiya PDF 4; ORIGINAL_REVIEW","payload":{"correct_option_id":"2e3c381f-e40a-564c-86e9-aaee09b7e554