steps\n  turn clockwise (90) degrees\nend\n```","options":["(0;0), o‘ngga","(40;0), o‘ngga","(0;40), yuqoriga","(0;0), chapga"],"correct":0,"explanation":"4×90°=360°. To‘rtta teng tomon kvadrat konturini yopib boshlang‘ich nuqta va yo‘nalishga qaytadi.","difficulty":3,"cognitive":"mulohaza","source":"ICT 5/6 (2020/2021) Scratch/LOGO mavzulari; 2026 spetsifikatsiya PDF 4","assets":[],"status":"review","lesson_id":"97000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004","construct_id":"15614f33-3e9d-4ac6-825f-64617661c946","source_reference":"M07-AUDIT-20261020:M07-A26-07; source=ICT 5/6 (2020/2021) Scratch/LOGO mavzulari; 2026 spetsifikatsiya PDF 4; ORIGINAL_REVIEW","payload":{"correct_option_id":"d2179fee-83d7-550b-bddb-0362c479cac1"},"option_rows":[{"id":"d2179fee-83d7-550b-bddb-0362c479cac1","side":"a","order_idx":0,"content":"(0;0), o‘ngga"},{"id":"483f1902-9c3d-5a73-a16d-78b825730a26","side":"a","order_idx":1,"content":"(40;0), o‘ngga"},{"id":"542c9cd9-83ba-5c5b-9bbc-b96962016f52","side":"a","order_idx":2,"content":"(0;40), yuqoriga"},{"id":"44a82a50-e6fb-50ab-b118-096afce69eeb","side":"a","order_idx":3,"content":"(0;0), chapga"}]},{"id":"M07-A26-08","uuid":"045760a7-e770-5487-b8e0-0c4ed088aa8d","lesson":5,"format":"Y1","stem":"Scratch Pen bilan `repeat (2) { repeat (3) { move 50; turn 120 } turn 60 }` bajarildi (pen down, to‘siqsiz sahna). Ichki sikllar jami nechta chiziq kesmasini chizadi?","options":["3 ta","5 ta","6 ta","12 ta"],"correct":2,"explanation":"Har bir ichki repeat 3 ta segment chizadi. Tashqi repeat 2 marta: jami 2×3=6 segment. Burilishning o‘zi yangi chiziq chizmaydi.","difficulty":3,"cognitive":"qollash","source":"ICT 5/6 (2020/2021) Scratch/LOGO mavzulari; 2026 spetsifikatsiya PDF 4","assets":[],"status":"review","lesson_id":"97000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004","construct_id":"15614f33-3e9d-4ac6-825f-64617661c946","source_reference":"M07-AUDIT-20261020:M07-A26-08; source=ICT 5/6 (2020/2021) Scratch/LOGO mavzulari; 2026 spetsifikatsiya PDF 4; ORIGINAL_REVIEW","payload":{"correct_option_id":"a8b3261e-b348-5768-96d0-c1b7f78a44c7"},"option_rows":[{"id":"9a950f50-ab4b-5417-9dc1-f5a4d5468aa2","side":"a","order_idx":0,"content":"3 ta"},{"id":"cc2d995f-2131-5d39-bebc-b91be672e3be","side":"a","order_idx":1,"content":"5 ta"},{"id":"a8b3261e-b348-5768-96d0-c1b7f78a44c7","side":"a","order_idx":2,"content":"6 ta"},{"id":"717fb170-4c78-5d21-ae41-cbbe7c34f49a","side":"a","order_idx":3,"content":"12 ta"}]},{"id":"M07-A26-09","uuid":"3858402c-a8bf-5b53-8fcf-4ba4f2445428","lesson":6,"format":"Y1","stem":"Klassik LOGOda qalam boshlang‘ichda tushirilgan. Quyidagi buyruqlardan so‘ng nechta **chizilgan** kesma hosil bo‘ladi?\n\n```logo\nPU\nFD 30\nPD\nREPEAT 4 [FD 40 RT 90]\n```","options":["4","5","3","0"],"correct":0,"explanation":"PU bilan 30 birlik yurishda iz yo‘q. PD dan keyingi 4 ta FD buyruq 4 ta kesma chizadi; burilish chiziq chizmaydi.","difficulty":3,"cognitive":"qollash","source":"ICT 5/6 (2020/2021) Scratch/LOGO mavzulari; 2026 spetsifikatsiya PDF 4","assets":[],"status":"review","lesson_id":"97000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005","construct_id":"584a2a03-0309-4f49-9919-eb9921bde95e","source_reference":"M07-AUDIT-20261020:M07-A26-09; source=ICT 5/6 (2020/2021) Scratch/LOGO mavzulari; 2026 spetsifikatsiya PDF 4; ORIGINAL_REVIEW","payload":{"correct_option_id":"9d3041a9-291e-5634-846d-2760d3b33fc8"},"option_rows":[{"id":"9d3041a9-291e-5634-846d-2760d3b33fc8","side":"a","order_idx":0,"content":"4"},{"id":"0871d6f7-2e0c-5642-a1d1-283e3593205e","side":"a","order_idx":1,"content":"5"},{"id":"e306eff9-f5ff-5bf8-8c8b-eef040847f02","side":"a","order_idx":2,"content":"3"},{"id":"d9609440-a252-5c36-bd49-ab4710ee87f7","side":"a","order_idx":3,"content":"0"}]},{"id":"M07-A26-10","uuid":"47a979a2-a892-5b81-bb74-e6a22ff64e5f","lesson":6,"format":"Y1","stem":"LOGOda `REPEAT 5 [FD 48 RT 72]` to‘liq bajarildi. Boshlang‘ich yo‘nalish va qalam holati odatiy bo‘lsa, qaysi muntazam ko‘pburchak chiziladi?","options":["Muntazam oltiburchak","Kvadrat","Muntazam beshburchak","Teng tomonli uchburchak"],"correct":2,"explanation":"Har safar 72° tashqi burchak bilan buriladi. 360°/72°=5, demak 5 tomonga ega muntazam beshburchak.","difficulty":3,"cognitive":"qollash","source":"ICT 5/6 (2020/2021) Scratch/LOGO mavzulari; 2026 spetsifikatsiya PDF 4","assets":[],"status":"review","lesson_id":"97000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005","construct_id":"584a2a03-0309-4f49-9919-eb9921bde95e","source_reference":"M07-AUDIT-20261020:M07-A26-10; source=ICT 5/6 (2020/2021) Scratch/LOGO mavzulari; 2026 spetsifikatsiya PDF 4; ORIGINAL_REVIEW","payload":{"correct_option_id":"511626af-ff3e-5ec2-bf2f-1be34a337e28"},"option_rows":[{"id":"d52471d1-84cf-5750-985c-d587c5d84702","side":"a","order_idx":0,"content":"Muntazam oltiburchak"},{"id":"bbad65ce-19c7-5394-a008-82656368dd5b","side":"a","order_idx":1,"content":"Kvadrat"},{"id":"511626af-ff3e-5ec2-bf2f-1be34a337e28","side":"a","order_idx":2,"content":"Muntazam beshburchak"},{"id":"b47ccd48-07b3-5697-8bfc-ae6d9bad0344","side":"a","order_idx":3,"content":"Teng tomonli uchburchak"}]},{"id":"M07-A26-11","uuid":"8ed3eb09-b2db-506d-970b-a0ec87903777","lesson":3,"format":"Y1","stem":"Scratchda ikkita **turli** skript mavjud:\n\n```text\nwhen green flag clicked\nbroadcast [start] and wait\nsay [Tayyor!]\n\nwhen I receive [start]\nwait (2) seconds\nsay [Ishlayapman] for (1) seconds\n```\n\nXabar qabul qiluvchi skript odatdagidek tugasa, [Tayyor!] xabari qachon boshlanadi?","options":["Xabar yuborilishi bilan darhol","Qabul qiluvchi skript tugagandan so‘ng","Yashil bayroq bosilishidan oldin","Faqat [start] ikkinchi marta yuborilganda"],"correct":1,"explanation":"broadcast ... and wait qabul qiluvchi skript(lar) yakunlanishini kutadi. Bu yerda 2 soniyalik kutish va 1 soniyalik say tugaydi, keyin Tayyor! boshlanadi.","difficulty":4,"cognitive":"mulohaza","source":"ICT 5/6 (2020/2021) Scratch/LOGO mavzulari; 2026 spetsifikatsiya PDF 4","assets":[],"status":"review","lesson_id":"97000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002","construct_id":"70313645-2af9-4ea5-b0c2-94aacf2ebe88","source_reference":"M07-AUDIT-20261020:M07-A26-11; source=ICT 5/6 (2020/2021) Scratch/LOGO mavzulari; 2026 spetsifikatsiya PDF 4; ORIGINAL_REVIEW","payload":{"correct_option_id":"4fe58f0b-edc9-5bc2-abc7-40ccc80be9fe"},"option_rows":[{"id":"59e0c78b-70ca-576a-ad60-f076c1f2660b","side":"a","order_idx":0,"content":"Xabar yuborilishi bilan darhol"},{"id":"4fe58f0b-edc9-5bc2-abc7-40ccc80be9fe","side":"a","order_idx":1,"content":"Qabul qiluvchi skript tugagandan so‘ng"},{"id":"8c61d8eb-a28f-5ba4-9348-20a813675871","side":"a","order_idx":2,"content":"Yashil bayroq bosilishidan oldin"},{"id":"2b6cf93c-e06e-5320-9def-01688b040096","side":"a","order_idx":3,"content":"Faqat [start] ikkinchi marta yuborilganda"}]},{"id":"M07-A26-12","uuid":"a279bed1-465c-5652-ac9d-221e51081eb3","lesson":6,"format":"Y1","stem":"Toshbaqa boshlanishda yuqoriga qaragan, qalam tushirilgan. Quyidagi LOGO kodi bajarilganda A–D rasmlardan qaysi shakl chiziladi? **Har bir ichki REPEAT kvadrat chizib boshlang‘ich burchakka qaytadi.**\n\n```logo\nREPEAT 3 [REPEAT 4 [FD 30 RT 90] FD 30]\nRT 45\nREPEAT 3 [REPEAT 4 [FD 30 RT 90] FD 30]\n```","options":["A","B","C","D"],"correct":1,"explanation":"Ichki REPEAT 4 [FD 30 RT 90] kvadrat chizib yo‘nalishni tiklaydi; undan keyingi FD 30 navbatdagi kvadratni boshlab beradi. Dastlab 3 kvadrat yuqoriga, RT 45 dan keyin yana 3 kvadrat 45° o‘ngga og‘ib chiziladi; B mos keladi.","difficulty":5,"cognitive":"mulohaza","source":"2026-04-13 attestatsiyada tushgan LOGO masalasi, PDF 4 (FAKAT USLUB); kod va rasm — mustaqil mualliflik varianti","assets":[{"kind":"image","diagram_id":"m07_logo_nested_squares_20261020","alt":"A–D variantlarda ikki yo‘nalishda ketma-ket kvadratlar chizilgan LOGO natijalari","src":"/m07-audit-2026/m07_logo_nested_squares_20261020.svg"}],"status":"review","lesson_id":"97000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005","construct_id":"584a2a03-0309-4f49-9919-eb9921bde95e","source_reference":"M07-AUDIT-20261020:M07-A26-12; source=2026-04-13 attestatsiyada tushgan LOGO masalasi, PDF 4 (FAKAT USLUB); kod va rasm — mustaqil mualliflik varianti; ORIGINAL_REVIEW","payload":{"correct_option_id":"0308f312-3c3a-528e-bbb8-4e3079a517e3"},"option_rows":[{"id":"9015dbe9-5908-5a42-965e-6544e4679390","side":"a","order_idx":0,"content":"A"},{"id":"0308f312-3c3a-528e-bbb8-4e3079a517e3","side":"a","order_idx":1,"content":"B"},{"id":"db091d7c-fa9d-54ce-b1f4-26a55444edc0","side":"a","order_idx":2,"content":"C"},{"id":"d6963b84-c311-5758-8dcd-45d4e642c07a","side":"a","order_idx":3,"content":"D"}]},{"id":"M07-A26-13","uuid":"7c81d6b8-c98e-5a03-92e0-daed3133f897","lesson":4,"format":"Y2","stem":"Quyidagi Scratch kodlarining `s` o‘zgaruvchisi uchun yakuniy natijalarini moslang. Har bir kod **s=0** dan boshlanadi.","pairs":[["repeat (3) { change [s] by (2) }","s = 6"],["repeat (4) { change [s] by (3) }","s = 12"],["repeat (5) { change [s] by (1) }","s = 5"],["repeat (2) { change [s] by (4) }","s = 8"]],"explanation":"Har bir takroriy buyruq uchun yakuniy s = takrorlanishlar soni × qo‘shish qiymati. Natijalar 6,12,5,8 bo‘lib o‘zaro takrorlanmaydi.","difficulty":3,"cognitive":"qollash","source":"ICT 6-sinf Scratch sikllari va 2026 spetsifikatsiya PDF 4; original mashq","assets":[],"status":"review","lesson_id":"97000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003","construct_id":"303d85fb-0395-4636-8668-e333cdc0fbf5","source_reference":"M07-AUDIT-20261020:M07-A26-13; source=ICT 6-sinf Scratch sikllari va 2026 spetsifikatsiya PDF 4; original mashq; ORIGINAL_REVIEW","payload":{"pairs":{"2e5f20b7-f8fd-5d49-94bf-abc445bfbe47":"1b1a347d-3e36-508a-9184-7f1a387c151f","7c740694-4601-5f00-88a6-2d1e87324d94":"9d6b02d6-ceeb-5e8d-b396-06fa04f199b1","ebebc98a-a1cd-508c-aa70-2fb0ba069c11":"102668db-1abd-5971-a741-e74dcfcefebe","3cbff071-06d6-5d84-9c32-ec35149b9280":"2e162b2a-548a-58a7-92e3-8d04815add14"}},"option_rows":[{"id":"2e5f20b7-f8fd-5d49-94bf-abc445bfbe47","side":"a","order_idx":0,"content":"repeat (3) { change [s] by (2) }"},{"id":"7c740694-4601-5f00-88a6-2d1e87324d94","side":"a","order_idx":1,"content":"repeat (4) { change [s] by (3) }"},{"id":"ebebc98a-a1cd-508c-aa70-2fb0ba069c11","side":"a","order_idx":2,"content":"repeat (5) { change [s] by (1) }"},{"id":"3cbff071-06d6-5d84-9c32-ec35149b9280","side":"a","order_idx":3,"content":"repeat (2) { change [s] by (4) }"},{"id":"1b1a347d-3e36-508a-9184-7f1a387c151f","side":"b","order_idx":0,"content":"s = 6"},{"id":"9d6b02d6-ceeb-5e8d-b396-06fa04f199b1","side":"b","order_idx":1,"content":"s = 12"},{"id":"102668db-1abd-5971-a741-e74dcfcefebe","side":"b","order_idx":2,"content":"s = 5"},{"id":"2e162b2a-548a-58a7-92e3-8d04815add14","side":"b","order_idx":3,"content":"s = 8"}]},{"id":"M07-A26-14","uuid":"8b74787a-ea14-5f35-85d2-df3aaeccc2af","lesson":6,"format":"Y3","stem":"LOGOda qalam izisiz oldinga 20 birlik o‘tib, so‘ng chapga yo‘nalib 40 birlik chiziq chizish uchun quyidagi to‘rtta buyruqni tartiblang. Qalam dastlab pastda (PD) deb oling.","order":["PU","FD 20","LT 90","PD\nFD 40"],"explanation":"Birinchi qalam ko‘tariladi, FD 20 izsiz yuriladi, LT 90 yo‘nalishni o‘zgartiradi, PD dan keyingi FD 40 chiziq chizadi.","difficulty":3,"cognitive":"mulohaza","source":"2026-04-13 LOGO kodi va ICT 5 Pen mavzusi uslubida mustaqil mashq","assets":[],"status":"review","lesson_id":"97000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005","construct_id":"584a2a03-0309-4f49-9919-eb9921bde95e","source_reference":"M07-AUDIT-20261020:M07-A26-14; source=2026-04-13 LOGO kodi va ICT 5 Pen mavzusi uslubida mustaqil mashq; ORIGINAL_REVIEW","payload":{"order":["416632e1-13e4-56e5-b32e-2a27c0df08df","6f1b3a9c-623c-5da6-9e1f-1538d4530627","7cd329be-ec6b-51fd-af5c-235dc72e10ca","711231bd-88b8-5de5-84b9-0bf732fe5f22"]},"option_rows":[{"id":"7cd329be-ec6b-51fd-af5c-235dc72e10ca","side":"a","order_idx":0,"content":"LT 90"},{"id":"416632e1-13e4-56e5-b32e-2a27c0df08df","side":"a","order_idx":1,"content":"PU"},{"id":"711231bd-88b8-5de5-84b9-0bf732fe5f22","side":"a","order_idx":2,"content":"PD\nFD 40"},{"id":"6f1b3a9c-623c-5da6-9e1f-1538d4530627","side":"a","order_idx":3,"content":"FD 20"}]}]$items$::jsonb;
 x jsonb; opt jsonb; mid uuid; sub uuid; cid uuid; qid uuid; inserted int:=0;
BEGIN
 SELECT id,subject_id INTO mid,sub FROM public.modules WHERE code='M07';
 IF mid IS NULL THEN
   RAISE NOTICE 'M07 not seeded in this environment; skip additive REVIEW bank';
   RETURN;
 END IF;
 -- CI fresh databases may carry a different/partial M07 edition. This review
 -- expansion belongs only after the twelve source-backed lessons are published.
 IF EXISTS (
   SELECT 1 FROM jsonb_array_elements(data) AS row(item)
   WHERE NOT EXISTS (
     SELECT 1 FROM public.lessons l
     JOIN public.lesson_constructs lc ON lc.lesson_id=l.id
     JOIN public.constructs c ON c.id=lc.construct_id
     WHERE l.id=(row.item->>'lesson_id')::uuid AND l.module_id=mid
       AND l.status='published' AND c.group_code='S4.BLOCK' AND c.is_active=true
   )
 ) THEN
   RAISE NOTICE 'Source-backed M07 published lessons/constructs absent; skip REVIEW bank safely';
   RETURN;
 END IF;
 FOR x IN SELECT value FROM jsonb_array_elements(data) LOOP
   qid := (x->>'uuid')::uuid;
   IF EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM public.questions WHERE id=qid) THEN
     IF NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM public.questions q WHERE q.id=qid AND q.status IN ('draft','review','published')
       AND q.source_reference=x->>'source_reference' AND q.stem_md=x->>'stem') THEN
       RAISE EXCEPTION 'Existing question changed or published. Explicit audit required: %',qid;
     END IF;
     CONTINUE;
   END IF;
   IF NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM public.lessons l WHERE l.id=(x->>'lesson_id')::uuid AND l.module_id=mid AND l.status='published') THEN
       RAISE EXCEPTION 'Required published M07 lesson missing: %',x->>'lesson_id';
   END IF;
   SELECT c.id INTO STRICT cid FROM public.lesson_constructs lc
   JOIN public.constructs c ON c.id=lc.construct_id
   WHERE lc.lesson_id=(x->>'lesson_id')::uuid
     AND c.group_code='S4.BLOCK' AND c.is_active=true
   ORDER BY c.id LIMIT 1;
   INSERT INTO public.questions(id,subject_id,construct_id,group_code,format,cognitive,difficulty,stem_md,assets,is_generated,status,source_reference,source_lesson_id)
   VALUES(qid,sub,cid,'S4.BLOCK',(x->>'format')::question_format,(x->>'cognitive')::cognitive_level,(x->>'difficulty')::integer,
    x->>'stem',x->'assets',false,'review'::content_status,x->>'source_reference',(x->>'lesson_id')::uuid);
   FOR opt IN SELECT value FROM jsonb_array_elements(x->'option_rows') LOOP
     INSERT INTO public.question_options(id,question_id,side,order_idx,content_md)
     VALUES((opt->>'id')::uuid,qid,(opt->>'side')::character,(opt->>'order_idx')::integer,opt->>'content');
   END LOOP;
   INSERT INTO public.question_keys(question_id,payload,explanation_md)
   VALUES(qid,x->'payload',x->>'explanation');
   inserted:=inserted+1;
 END LOOP;
 RAISE NOTICE 'Imported % new review questions',inserted;
END $import$;